<title>USA: IMCO Recycling Inc Q3 shr drops with charge.</title>
<headline>IMCO Recycling Inc Q3 shr drops with charge.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  For the three months  For the nine months</p>
<p>			     ended Sept. 30,	ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>				  1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> REVENUES		  $53,689    $32,105 $154,872    $92,576</p>
<p>  NET EARNINGS (LOSS) (798)(1)	3,327    4,763(1) $ 9,180</p>
<p>Net earnings (loss) per</p>
<p>   common share	(0.07)(1)	 0.27     0.39(1) $  0.76</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>   shares outstanding   12,009     12,129   12,335     12,020</p>
<p>NOTE - (1)  Includes an after-tax charge of $2,710,000 or $.23 per common share, for the write-down of fixed assets and inventories to net realizable values as a result of the shutdown of the Corona, Calif., plant and the decision to accelerate to closure of the first cell of a company-owned landfill.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
